# This repo is PUBLIC and frontend-only. Never commit credentials or the
# Python data tooling (which lives in ~/Documents/Archive/GeoTab, off GitHub).
# '*.py' does NOT match '*.pyc' — the compiled form of engine.py slipped
# through that gap and was tracked in this PUBLIC repo from 5b4673e until
# 2026-08-07, swept in by a broad `git add` on an unrelated commit. Ignore the
# compiled artefacts explicitly, not just the source.
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/
scorecard/
NOTES.md
*.json
!config/*.json
# The company benchmark is the score's reference distribution and must be
# diffable — it is 110 rate breakpoints with no names, vehicles or branch
# labels in it, so it is safe in a public repo. Everything else stays ignored.
!benchmark/company-30d.json
*.csv
.env
.DS_Store
credentials*
secrets*
